## Middlewares
- Stateless and composable. Inject dependencies; avoid singletons.
- Validate payloads early (PII, content safety, prompt injection).
- Structured logs with telemetry contexts.
- Deterministic cache keys including relevant headers/body.
- Make thresholds/limits configurable via env/config.

## Providers
- Map provider-specific payloads to internal request/response types.
- Localize provider conditionals. Don't leak provider flags upstream.
- Normalize streaming events and tokens across providers.
- Read keys/endpoints from env/config. No hard-coded credentials.
- Retries with backoff for transient errors (avoid retrying 4xx).
- Add timeouts. Surface errors with provider context.

## Plugins
- Follow manifest schema (`manifest.json`).
- Keep plugins isolated. Export clear interfaces.
- Document capabilities and configuration requirements.

